<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>A long, long road I traveled night and day,</l><l>And sought to find within myself some way,</l><l>Aught I could do, or feel to bring me near;</l><l>Self effort failed, and I was filled with fear,</l><l>And then I found Christ was the only way</l><l>That I must come to Him and in Him stay.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
